{
    "type": "multi_action",
    "pause": false,
    "title": {
        "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.title",
        "fallback": "第五章 · 导弹与空战",
        "color": "gold",
        "bold": true
    },
    "body": [
        {
            "type": "plain_message",
            "width": 500,
            "contents": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.h1",
                "fallback": "【三种导弹】",
                "color": "yellow"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "plain_message",
            "width": 500,
            "contents": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.l1",
                "fallback": "%1$s（烈焰棒）：追空中，84 伤　|　%2$s（旋风棒）：追地面，46 伤　|　%3$s（骨头）：追空中，84 伤，手持移速减半。",
                "with": [
                    { "translate": "djzc.missile_aa", "color": "gold" },
                    { "translate": "djzc.missile_ag", "color": "gold" },
                    { "translate": "djzc.fishing_rod", "color": "gold" }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "plain_message",
            "width": 500,
            "contents": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.h2",
                "fallback": "【发射流程】",
                "color": "yellow"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "plain_message",
            "width": 500,
            "contents": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.l2",
                "fallback": "手持导弹长按 %1$s 约 1.6 秒完成发射；长按期间，你面前 60° 锥形、128 格内所有人（不分敌我）会发光——这是雷达锁定，对方也能看到自己亮了。",
                "with": [
                    { "keybind": "key.use", "color": "gold", "bold": true }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "plain_message",
            "width": 500,
            "contents": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.l3",
                "fallback": "发射后自动追击最近的合法目标（约 33 米/秒），3 格内近炸；导弹寿命有限（空空 3 秒 / 空地 2 秒 / 地空 6 秒），出手前先把机头对准目标方向。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "plain_message",
            "width": 500,
            "contents": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.h3",
                "fallback": "【告警与干扰】",
                "color": "yellow"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "plain_message",
            "width": 500,
            "contents": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.l4",
                "fallback": "敌方导弹进入 100 格：铁砧声每半秒响一次，声音方向就是导弹方向——听声辨位，立刻机动！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "plain_message",
            "width": 500,
            "contents": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.l5",
                "fallback": "右键 %1$s：身边弹出干扰鸡（存活 5 秒），敌方导弹会优先追鸡。Q 键丢投掷物骗导弹的老办法已失效。",
                "with": [
                    { "translate": "djzc.jam_egg", "color": "gold" }
                ],
                "color": "aqua"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "plain_message",
            "width": 500,
            "contents": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.h4",
                "fallback": "【机场】",
                "color": "yellow"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "plain_message",
            "width": 500,
            "contents": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.l6",
                "fallback": "己方机场停留 30 秒获补给：%1$s ×4、%2$s ×8、烟花 ×5、%3$s ×5（军械仅限航空兵种领取）。",
                "with": [
                    { "translate": "djzc.missile_aa", "color": "gold" },
                    { "translate": "djzc.missile_ag", "color": "gold" },
                    { "translate": "djzc.jam_egg", "color": "gold" }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "plain_message",
            "width": 500,
            "contents": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.ch05.l7",
                "fallback": "敌空军进入己方机场 75 格内：机场每秒自动发射 1 枚地空导弹拦截；跑道上的弹射器给你速度 + 漂浮，踩它起飞。"
            }
        }
    ],
    "columns": 2,
    "actions": [
        {
            "label": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.nav.prev",
                "fallback": "◀ 上一章",
                "color": "aqua"
            },
            "action": {
                "type": "show_dialog",
                "dialog": "djzc777:tutorial/ch04"
            }
        },
        {
            "label": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.nav.home",
                "fallback": "返回主页",
                "color": "gold"
            },
            "action": {
                "type": "show_dialog",
                "dialog": "djzc777:tutorial/root"
            }
        },
        {
            "label": {
                "translate": "djzc777.dialog.nav.next",
                "fallback": "下一章 ▶",
                "color": "aqua"
            },
            "action": {
                "type": "show_dialog",
                "dialog": "djzc777:tutorial/ch06"
            }
        }
    ],
    "exit_action": {
        "label": {
            "translate": "djzc777.dialog.nav.home",
            "fallback": "返回主页"
        },
        "action": {
            "type": "show_dialog",
            "dialog": "djzc777:tutorial/root"
        }
    }
}
